{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Kassel, August 19\n\nMy dear Marie,\n\nI am writing to you from the inn. The journey through Hesse was long and tiring. After the first night's ride in the overstuffed post coach, we reached Halle at noon. There I picked up Hinrichs, and we ate and slept in the afternoon. At six o'clock we continued on to Nordhausen, where I spent the night with a student. Early yesterday morning, at six, we resumed the journey with students to Kassel.\n\nMy head is full of roads, dust, and the murmuring of travelers. The landscape here is hilly, but nothing that would keep my thoughts away from you. I am tired, but my spirit is awake.\n\nGive my kisses to Karl and Immanuel. Tell Ludwig that I am thinking of him. I hope the wine in Berlin is good and that the cards went well in the evenings.\n\nYour faithful\nG.W.F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795221230,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":199,"prompt_tokens":282,"total_tokens":481,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-eMVNJt3Mahg5H8n39QQdcSS5ugXnnuLV","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":282,"prompt_ms":442.497,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.5691382978723405,"prompt_per_second":637.2924562200423,"predicted_n":199,"predicted_ms":4676.919,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.62080303030303,"predicted_per_second":42.33556322014557}}